    "hypothesis": "A serial bounded max-heap paired with per-group x/y structure-of-arrays storage should reduce selection work and improve coordinate scanning on the ARM64 target. Falling back to the original selection logic on NaN distances preserves its behavior where a total heap ordering is unavailable; OpenMP is omitted because the archived parallel candidates were slower.",
